    iqContext: "Ma's estimated IQ of 132 reflects above-average intelligence expressed primarily through interpersonal, strategic, and entrepreneurial channels rather than technical ones. He has never written a line of code and does not have a technical background — making his founding of one of the world's largest technology companies an unusual case in the history of the internet. His cognitive strengths appear to lie in reading people and situations, constructing compelling narratives about the future, and building organizational cultures. His charisma and communication ability — delivered through speeches that combine folksy humor with genuine commercial insight — have been central to his leadership effectiveness. His political difficulties beginning in 2020, when he publicly criticized Chinese financial regulators and subsequently withdrew from public life, illustrate that even extraordinary business intelligence may be insufficient preparation for the political dimensions of operating at scale in China.",
